# Editors #
## Visual Studio Code ##
### Workspace Folder ###
/.vscode/**

### Exceptions ###
!/.vscode/extensions.json
!/.vscode/launch.json
!/.vscode/tasks.json
!/.vscode/*.code-snippets
!/.vscode/*.code-workspace

## Vim ##
### Swap ###
[._]*.s[a-v][a-z]
[._]*.sw[a-p]
[._]*.s[a-rt-v][a-z]
[._]*.ss[a-gi-z]
[._]sw[a-p]

### Session ###
Session.vim
Sessionx.vim

### Temporary Files ###
.netrwhist
*~

### Auto-generated Tag Files ###
tags
ctags

### Undo Persistence ###
[._]*.un~

# Logs #
*.log*

# Environment #
## General ##
**/.env*

# Cache #
## CSpell ##
.cspellcache

# Compiled Lua Sources
luac.out

# luarocks Build Files
*.src.rock
*.zip
*.tar.gz

